id "c5453ef5-4b15-5cbd-af32-541aa54e44cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-101504" :question/problem "Find the angle between $a=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-1)\\cdot 4+4\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 3}{\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}}\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{21}\\cdot \\sqrt{26}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{546}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{546}})≈{75.12}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-101504/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a087e7bc-4e74-584d-af3b-bf6bee4b75ea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-101504"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-18320"] :question/worked-solution "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 6+7\\cdot 1}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{7}^{2}}\\sqrt{{6}^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{\\sqrt{53}\\cdot \\sqrt{37}} \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{\\sqrt{1961}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{19}{\\sqrt{1961}})≈{64.6}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-19027/selection/22a5820f83fb72b303cc5e52828d74d7748120d62eb9cb66a6cf0a744ada6bb1" :answer/id #uuid "e2865549-e3e9-581d-a55