end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\cdot 4+4\\cdot 2}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{4}^{2}}\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{\\sqrt{20}\\cdot \\sqrt{20}} \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{20} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{4}{5})≈{36.87}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-19027/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a087e7bc-4e74-584d-af3b-bf6bee4b75ea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-19027"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036/selection/10f830e086e732f19820e3f4b8b0f46636300429797c017e8a6d05de13400820" :answer/id #uuid "8963ce6a-0bfd-5fd2-b165-d792ada55b90" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{82.28}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036/selection/a0cf4cc2d639fa6ca5b995bb1c3ea779a8323586d6f3c9798290b3361c284377" :answer/id #uuid "bc6a8900-1583-5035-b877-a331a777d7a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{79.76}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036/selection/d921298dd458cdafb962ea059a56ebf9eed49bb288d8108ce7a8586ea162cccc" :answer/id #uuid "6745ac4a-89a9-5753-84d7-9c7d0584dc63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{85.82}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036/selection/a7e26c70bd471ac887133ee00c736e6e6a9e9a6898bf024362b473b389c1e15d" :answer/id #uuid "5826b01a-a2bb-59f5-97f6-55db95fe21e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{94.32}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036/selection/0e57c17a5e4abc5e7ebe143f632ec5afafcb3fcd53cf2604b1ca0dffd79e6556" :answer/id #uuid "8afbfb09-b22c-5fb4-ad63-9b272b5b0f58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{74.66}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a854aaae-2f37-5309-b178-44153a0fe3f7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-19036/selection/d921298dd458cdafb962ea059a56ebf9eed49bb288d8108ce7a8586ea162cccc" :answer-field/choices ["q-19036/selection/10f830e086e732f19820e3f4b8b0f46636300429797c017e8a6d05de13400820" "q-19036/selection/a0cf4cc2d639fa6ca5b995bb1c3ea779a8323586d6f3c9798290b3361c284377" "q-19036/selection/d921298dd458cdafb962ea059a56ebf9eed49bb288d8108ce7a8586ea162cccc" "q-19036/selection/a7e26c70bd471ac887133ee00c736e6e6a9e9a6898bf024362b473b389c1e15d" "q-19036/selection/0e57c17a5e4abc5e7ebe143f632ec5afafcb3fcd53cf2604b1ca0dffd79e6556"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-19036" :question/id #uuid "de2bc7db-4647-58f0-bdd4-89b0098b6ec1" :question/math-academy-id "q-19036" :question/problem "Find the angle between $a=⟨4,-3,2⟩$ and $b=⟨3,4,1⟩.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." :question/worked-solution "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\cdot 3+(-3)\\cdot 4+2\\cdot 1}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+{2}^{2}}\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{4}^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{29}\\cdot \\sqrt{26}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{754}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{754}})≈{85.82}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-19036/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a087e7bc-4e74-584d-af3b-bf6bee4b75ea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-19036"] :db/ensur